WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.400
[Silent video, no audio] The House Lights board opens on the Quiz Time logo, eight tables at zero.

00:03.500 --> 00:12.400
The categories flip on one at a time and the board fills with values from 100 to 500.

00:12.500 --> 00:17.800
The TV glides aside and a guest's phone slides in. The guest types the room code, picks a table and joins the show.

00:17.850 --> 00:19.600
A Quiz Time clue opens and the phone's BUZZ button goes live.

00:19.600 --> 00:22.000
The clue on the board: "These three letters in an email send a copy nobody else on the thread can see."

00:22.100 --> 00:26.300
The presses land in order. The phone reads SENT, in line, number 2. Table 5 misses and Table 3 is up.

00:26.400 --> 00:31.500
Correct: BCC, blind carbon copy. Table 3 scores 120.

00:31.900 --> 00:39.500
Speed Trivia: "Which planet is closest to the sun?" The options appear one at a time and the phone shows PRESS.

00:39.600 --> 00:41.900
All four options are out and the phones lock in: five of eight tables have answered.

00:42.000 --> 00:45.600
Mercury is right and the scores move.

00:45.700 --> 00:49.400
Full screen again for the standings: Table 1 leads with 200, Table 2 has 150, Table 3 has 120.

00:49.500 --> 00:54.200
The winner screen: Table 1 takes it under confetti, and the demo fades to black.
